"""
Wikipedia Credentials Configuration (LEGACY - NOT RECOMMENDED)

Prefer environment variables instead:
- Local development: copy .env.example to .env (see docs/WIKIPEDIA_BOT_SETUP.md)
- Production: inject WIKIPEDIA_USERNAME / WIKIPEDIA_PASSWORD via your
  deployment environment (Docker secrets, systemd Environment=, CI/CD
  secrets) without writing any file to disk.

This file is only used as a last-resort fallback when no environment
variable is set. Copy it to the PROJECT ROOT as passwords.py (not inside
config/) and fill in your actual credentials.
DO NOT commit passwords.py to version control.
"""

